[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0010","text":"小糸酱，去找透前辈她们吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0020","text":"好、好啊\n我马上准备好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0030","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0040","text":"──哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0050","text":"啊哈～！\n好漂亮呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0060","text":"呀……！　透酱和圆香酱\n已经在等了……！　得赶紧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0070","text":"『快看！樱花好厉害！\n　我再拍几张就过去！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0080","text":"『糟了』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0090","text":"『小糸也一起？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0100","text":"『嗯，一起呢\n　对不起，我也稍微晚一点』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200500_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
